          body: T('随机生成 1000 个自旋 ½ 的态，对每个态算出 σ_x 和 σ_y 的标准差之积，验证它总不小于 |⟨σ_z⟩|（Robertson 关系的特例，因为 [σ_x, σ_y] = 2iσ_z），并找出取等号的态。再验证测量 σ_z 得 +1 的概率等于 |⟨↑|ψ⟩|²，期望值等于 ⟨ψ|σ_z|ψ⟩。',
            'Generate 1000 random spin-½ states, compute the product of the standard deviations of σ_x and σ_y for each, and check that it is never smaller than |⟨σ_z⟩| (a special case of Robertson, since [σ_x, σ_y] = 2iσ_z); find the states where equality holds. Then check that the probability of measuring σ_z = +1 is |⟨↑|ψ⟩|² and that the expectation value is ⟨ψ|σ_z|ψ⟩.'),
          code: 'import numpy as np\nsx = np.array([[0, 1], [1, 0]]); sy = np.array([[0, -1j], [1j, 0]]); sz = np.diag([1, -1])\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0); worst = np.inf\nfor _ in range(1000):\n    psi = rng.normal(size=2) + 1j * rng.normal(size=2); psi /= np.linalg.norm(psi)\n    ev = lambda A: np.vdot(psi, A @ psi).real\n    lhs = np.sqrt(1 - ev(sx)**2) * np.sqrt(1 - ev(sy)**2)   # sigma_A^2 = 1 - <A>^2 for Pauli matrices\n    worst = min(worst, lhs - abs(ev(sz)))\nprint(worst >= -1e-12)   # True: the bound is never violated',
