          body: T('用 NumPy 构造单态 |Ψ⁻⟩，定义沿 x–z 平面内角度 θ 的自旋算符 σ(θ) = cos θ σ_z + sin θ σ_x，算出 a = 0、a′ = 90°、b = 45°、b′ = 135° 时的 CHSH 组合，得到 S = −2√2 ≈ −2.828（|S| 超过定域理论的上限 2）。再把单态换成直积态或经典混合态 ½(|↑↓⟩⟨↑↓| + |↓↑⟩⟨↓↑|)，看 |S| 能不能超过 2。',
            'Build the singlet |Ψ⁻⟩ in NumPy, define the spin operator along angle θ in the x–z plane as σ(θ) = cos θ σ_z + sin θ σ_x, and evaluate the CHSH combination for a = 0, a′ = 90°, b = 45°, b′ = 135°: you should get S = −2√2 ≈ −2.828 (|S| exceeds the local bound of 2). Then replace the singlet by a product state or the classical mixture ½(|↑↓⟩⟨↑↓| + |↓↑⟩⟨↓↑|) and see whether |S| can exceed 2.'),
