        practice: {
          title: T('积分一个退相位的量子比特', 'Integrating a dephasing qubit'),
          body: T('从 |+x⟩ 的密度矩阵出发，用 Lindblad 算符 √γ σ_z（γ = 1/2T₂）做显式 Euler 积分，到 t = 3T₂ 时相干项 |ρ₀₁| 应等于 ½e^{−3} ≈ 0.0249，布居不变，纯度从 1 降到约 0.501。再加一个能量弛豫算符 σ₋，看 T₁ 过程怎样同时改变布居和相干。',
            'Start from the density matrix of |+x⟩ and integrate with an explicit Euler step using the Lindblad operator √γ σ_z (γ = 1/2T₂). At t = 3T₂ the coherence |ρ₀₁| should equal ½e^{−3} ≈ 0.0249, the populations should not change, and the purity should fall from 1 to about 0.501. Then add an energy-relaxation operator σ₋ and see how a T₁ process changes both populations and coherences.'),
          code: 'import numpy as np\nsz = np.diag([1.0, -1.0]); T2 = 1.0; gamma = 1 / (2 * T2)\nrho = 0.5 * np.array([[1, 1], [1, 1]], dtype=complex)   # |+x><+x|\ndt, steps = 1e-3, 3000\nfor _ in range(steps):\n    rho = rho + dt * gamma * (sz @ rho @ sz - rho)\nprint(round(abs(rho[0, 1]), 4), round(0.5 * np.exp(-3), 4), round(np.trace(rho @ rho).real, 4))\n# 0.0249 0.0249 0.5012',
        },
