          body: T('用径向积分 f(q) = −(2m/ħ²q)∫ r sin(qr) V(r) dr 数值算 Yukawa 势的一阶 Born 振幅，和解析式 −2mV₀/ħ²(μ² + q²) 对照（ħ = m = 1）。再只保留 s 波，算硬球截面 4π sin²(ka)/k² 与几何截面 πa² 之比，看它在 k → 0 时趋于 4。',
            'Compute the first Born amplitude of a Yukawa potential numerically from the radial integral f(q) = −(2m/ħ²q)∫ r sin(qr) V(r) dr and compare with the closed form −2mV₀/ħ²(μ² + q²) (ħ = m = 1). Then keep only the s wave and compute the ratio of the hard-sphere cross section 4π sin²(ka)/k² to the geometric πa², and watch it approach 4 as k → 0.'),
